        "**STUDENT REASONING**\n",
        "1. V1 produced generic summaries that introduces interpretive language and missed key financial details. It said business was slow 'due to the festive season', a claim not in the letter. V2 clearly states the fact that the letter said it will improve after the season and doesnt blame the season for the slowdown, which V1 did.\n",
